# Vendored fork, kept line-identical with upstream ProfileStore v1.0.3 so it can
# still be diffed against it. Scribe's own additions are marked `SCRIBE PATCH`
# inside it; everything Scribe writes around it (init.luau) is formatted normally.
#
# Depth-agnostic on purpose: the format gate is run against LF copies of the tree
# at a different root, and a root-relative pattern silently stops matching there.
**/Internal/Store/ProfileStore.luau
